WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.230
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
Agents of SHIELD wrapped up part 2 of the

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:12.861
first episode, introduced another big villain
and set up a big arc that will spill over

00:00:12.861 --> 00:00:14.940
into the phase 3 movies.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:20.850
Lots of stuff to get through, so grab yourself
some damn fine coffee and careful for spoilers...I’ll

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.460
wait just a sec while you get that coffee...okay.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.450
Here we go, top 5 moments:

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:30.670
Number 5 - FitzMack hacks the Quintjet Cloaking
Device and Absorbing Man

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.509
FitzMack is the new name of their team.

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:35.649
As an offshoot WTF is Simmons if they all
think she bailed?

00:00:35.649 --> 00:00:42.229
She’s in the promo pics for episode 3, so
we won’t have to wait to find out.

00:00:42.229 --> 00:00:45.300
Fitz on the other hand is going off the deep
end.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.699
I noticed he seemed much more lucid when he
was hallucinating Simmons, but when he was

00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:52.079
talking to normal people he seemed way crazier.

00:00:52.079 --> 00:01:05.269
It felt a little inconsistent, but the hallucinations
will have to be explained at some point.

00:01:05.269 --> 00:01:10.670
Either his brain is going to explode from
trauma or it will help him unlock secrets

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:25.479
of the universe and 
hack that obelisk tech.

00:01:25.479 --> 00:01:29.560
Sometimes when you suffer brain injuries in
the Marvel Universe, you can see across time

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:37.250
and space.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:41.679
Really digging Fitz and Mack together, I know
everyone wanted Mack to be Luke Cage.

00:01:41.679 --> 00:01:46.890
But they’re probably going to roll that
character out during the Netflix shows next

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:47.950
year.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:59.180
I’m hoping the Fitz crazy person plot ties
in with the Coulson crazy person plot and

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.219
the obelisk.

00:02:02.219 --> 00:02:05.299
Number 4 - Coulson Needs Some Dry Erase Markers

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:08.869
Did anyone else wonder that while he was carving
up that board.

00:02:08.869 --> 00:02:18.870
When he’s done though he’ll be able to
sell it on etsy and make enough money to pay

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.970
Hunter for his services.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:29.780
I’m sure there’s a lot of demand out there
for giant coffee tables carved with the ancient

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.610
language of the universe.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.330
I feel like the 18 days is very important
to what’s happening, it’s part of some

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:40.250
cycle Coulson is on.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:44.970
Some early theories for what’s going on
include Gem-related Tech, as in the Soul Gems

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:48.590
are conscious entities capable of exerting
their will.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:53.120
So maybe the obelisk is tied to a Gem and
the Gem is just inceptioning all these different

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.450
people in the way the Tesseract inceptioned
Hawkeye and Doctor Selvig.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:01.130
What I think it’s doing is causing them
to bring about some pre-determined outcome.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:08.340
Like the power behind the obelisk, whether
it’s a Gem or a Terrigen Crystal, is communicating

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:14.340
with Coulson trying to get him to do what
it wants.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:18.590
Terrigen Crystals don’t really work that
way, but Gems can do that.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.960
And based on the way Raina and Skye’s Father
talked about the obelisk, it makes me think

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:26.370
it’s more gem related than terrigen crystal.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.320
I don’t think the obelisk itself is a straight
up gem.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.820
I just think it’s connected to the gems
somehow.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.681
Number 3 - Absorbing Man absorbs the Obelisk

00:03:33.681 --> 00:03:38.150
I like that it’s effect on him goes beyond
his human physiology.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:42.040
I think we’re just meant to take away that
the Obelisk is more alien and more powerful

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.990
than anyone understands.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.450
Not including The Captain.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.330
He seems like the only one who has a clue.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:53.670
The HYDRA person was able to talk him down
and he fixed himself, so whatever the obelisk

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:58.930
did to him, it’s effects aren’t clear.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:01.500
He did get away with Raina’s carbite ring.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:05.340
The whole purpose of that was to make him
near indestructible.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.060
When she said “Store Energy” didn’t
you just wonder whether or not it would be

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.340
able to absorb a hit from the destroyer gun?

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.200
I feel like that’s the real tease with absorbing
man.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:18.410
Like the obelisk and the carbite will make
him so powerful, coulson and Talbot won’t

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.290
be able to take him down with energy based
weapons.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.720
They did neutralize him though.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:27.160
But Coulson explained that he’s only been
turned to rock and it won’t stick.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:32.540
So expect Absorbing Man to be back in a future
episode.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.760
Number 2 - Black Panther Shout Out

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:38.660
This wasn’t necessarily a Black Panther
teaser, I think the character is big enough

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.250
they’d intro him in one of the movies.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.550
The reference was Operation Panther Claw.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.510
They never said Wakanda.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:50.000
The interesting thing about Wakanda though
is that it has extremely advanced tech.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.470
So if they’re dealing with Gem-related tech
or Kree tech or whatever the obelisk is, Wakanda

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:58.360
could be somewhere for them to get help.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:03.000
and my Number 1 moment - Meet The Doctor,
Kyle Machlacan

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.680
His name right now is just “The Doctor”,
they haven’t revealed his first or last

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.680
name.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:14.930
Right off the bat here’s what I think, He’s
human and very clearly not working with HYDRA,

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:20.720
which means we have our three factions:

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:26.500
Team Coulson, which you could also consider
Team Avengers, HYDRA and Kraken and now this

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.230
new group Raina and The Doctor are working
with.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:34.320
He isn’t confirmed evil right now, just
a separate entity.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:40.510
The big question is based on the Big Plan
Raina teased, who are they and what does it

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:41.512
mean about the obelisk?

00:05:41.512 --> 00:05:45.800
The first thing my mind goes to is inhumans
and Kree tech.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:49.370
We only saw the kree in guardians of the galaxy
for a brief second.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.610
Not including Ronan.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:54.760
But the Kree were behind Terrigen Crystals
in the comics and the Crystals were responsible

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.750
for the creation of the Inhumans.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:01.730
It’s possible that they’re modifying aspects
of that story to work more with the guardians

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:08.900
of the galaxy gem story that the collector
teased.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:16.050
You remember the scene where he explains all
of the gems and what they’re capable of.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.840
The markings could just be the language of
the celestials.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.840
Like an ancient language of the universe.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.990
That doesn’t explain who Kyle Machlaclan
is.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:28.460
He could be a character from the comics, but
we’ll probably have to wait to find out.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.730
Next week is a big HYDRA story.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:35.371
Let me know what your favorite moment was
and do you think the Obelisk is going to be

00:06:35.371 --> 00:06:36.590
part of an Inhumans storyline?

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:40.870
Remember, they could just replace the terrigen
crystals with modified gem-technology.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.869
They’re changing ultron’s origins in the
movies, so they can get rid of terrigen crystals

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:43.869
too.

00:06:43.869 --> 00:06:47.980
Big things to watch for next week are Kraken,
who we’ll learn a bunch more about and we’ll

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.330
learn what Simmons has been doing, with HYDRA
aparrently.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.600
My guess is that she’s been trying to infiltrate
them.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:07:04.919
I don’t think she straight up turned like
Ward.

00:07:04.919 --> 00:07:09.360
Overall I gave the episode an A minus for
being a well executed second half of a two

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.750
part premiere.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.220
Technically it wasn’t a two parter, but
the story was such a continuation of the events

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:19.190
from episode 1, it should have been called
part 2.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:23.880
The show also earns extra points for wasting
no time in mapping out the big players of

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:28.980
the season and what they’re going after.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:32.980
The Doctor and Raina are trying to unlock
the powers of the obelisk and get Skye.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:37.300
Who is probably the key to controlling it.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.080
Why else would he want her so badly.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:44.460
It doesn’t seem like love is what inspired
him to order Raina to grab her.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:49.570
HYDRA and Kraken also want the obelisk, but
at the same time want to grab as many remaining

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.169
SHIELD people as possible.

00:07:51.169 --> 00:07:53.960
World Domination, so 1945.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:58.229
And Coulson is trying to unlock the mystery
of the Celestial Language while cleaning up

00:07:58.229 --> 00:08:01.770
the HYDRA mess and keeping the world from
falling apart.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:07.591
The thing that’s really sucking me in to
the story is trying to puzzle together how

00:08:07.591 --> 00:08:08.591
everything is connected.

00:08:08.591 --> 00:08:12.560
How all the side plots with the characters
are going to come together at the end of the

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.560
year.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:19.550
I totally think they’ll explain what the
Obelisk is by the end of the season.

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:23.510
In terms of performances, I think Absorbing
Man is going to be an interesting recurring

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:24.510
character.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:32.390
He got a lot more dialogue in this episode,
Coulson of course is always the most fun.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:36.450
And I’m really happy to see Raina back,
she was one of the more interesting additions

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.159
last year.

00:08:38.159 --> 00:08:41.909
The show really is feeling more and more like
a movie which I think is amazing.

00:08:41.909 --> 00:08:46.639
I never expect that level of execution from
a tv show, but SHIELD is throwing down the

00:08:46.639 --> 00:08:49.350
gauntlet in front of the other comic book
shows this year.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.910
Arrow and the Flash will definitely be up
to the challenge, it’s going to be a fun

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:53.910
year.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:58.300
Because I have some extra time tomorrow, I’ll
do another Q&amp;A for this.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.279
Be sure to subscribe and leave all of the
questions.

00:09:01.279 --> 00:09:03.740
I’ve also been live tweeting while the episodes
are on tv, so you can follow me there if you

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.899
want to play along.

00:09:06.899 --> 00:09:10.740
Right now click here for the Q&amp;A, I’ll add
the annotation tomorrow when I post the video

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.779
and click here for my episode 1 video.

00:09:12.779 --> 00:09:16.939
Thanks for watching, everybody high five and
we’ll meet up tomorrow!

